          {
            "title": "Explain the Failed Import",
            "id": 152102,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Welcher Handler erfasst die Konvertierungsdetails und identifiziert den fehlgeschlagenen Import?</p><selection iscode=\"true\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>except ValueError as error: print(\"Import failed:\", error)</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>except ValueError: print(\"Import failed:\", error)</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>except: print(\"Import failed\")</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>except ValueError as error: print(\"Import failed:\", error)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ein Import verwendet <code>float(\"free\")</code>. Welcher Handler zeigt seine erfassten Details an und lässt Fehler wegen fehlender Keys unbehandelt?</p><selection iscode=\"true\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">except ValueError as error: print(\"Import failed:\", error)</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">except ValueError: print(\"Import failed:\", error)</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">except KeyError as error: print(\"Import failed:\", error)</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">except Exception as error: print(\"Import failed:\", error)</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">except ValueError as error: print(\"Import failed:\", error).</p></body></html>",
